    {
      "id": "east-embers",
      "type": "adventure",
      "x": 1300,
      "speaker": "",
      "lines": [
        "A campfire ring beside the path. The ash is fresh — still faintly warm.",
        "Whoever sat here left in no hurry. Heading east, down toward the green."
      ],
      "choices": [
        "Rest a moment by the embers",
        "Hurry after them"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "The warmth lingers. For the first time in a long while, the road ahead feels close.",
        "Down the slopes, then. They cannot be far now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "east-relic",
      "type": "interest",
      "x": 1800
    },
    {
      "id": "east-relic-2",
